{"b":"Ps","c":76,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"In Judah is God known: his name is great in Israel.","it":[[9,11],[32,34]],"x":[["1Chr.29.10",5,"r"],["1Chr.29.12",5,"r"],["Dan.3.29",5,"r"],["Acts.17.23",4,"r"],["Dan.4.1",4,"r"],["Dan.4.2",4,"r"],["Ps.48.1",3,"r"],["Ps.48.3",3,"w"],["Ps.148.13",3,"r"],["Ps.148.14",3,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"In Salem also is his tabernacle, and his dwelling place in Zion.","x":[["Gen.14.18",8,"w"],["Isa.12.6",5,"w"],["Ps.132.13",4,"w"],["Ps.132.14",4,"r"],["2Chr.6.6",4,"r"],["Ps.27.5",3,"w"],["Lam.2.6",3,"w"],["Heb.7.1",3,"w"],["Heb.7.2",3,"w"],["Ps.9.11",3,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"There brake he the arrows of the bow, the shield, and the sword, and the battle. Selah.","x":[["Ps.46.9",7,"w"],["Ezek.39.3",2,"w"],["Ezek.39.4",2,"r"],["Ezek.39.9",2,"w"],["Ezek.39.10",2,"r"],["2Chr.32.21",1,"w"],["2Chr.20.25",1,"r"],["2Chr.14.12",1,"r"],["2Chr.14.13",1,"r"],["Isa.37.35",1,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Thou art more glorious and excellent than the mountains of prey.","it":[[5,8],[23,26]],"x":[["Ezek.19.1",4,"r"],["Ezek.19.4",4,"r"],["Dan.7.17",3,"r"],["Dan.7.28",3,"r"],["Jer.4.7",2,"r"],["Ezek.19.6",2,"w"],["Dan.7.4",2,"r"],["Dan.7.8",2,"r"],["Ezek.38.12",2,"w"],["Ezek.38.13",2,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"The stouthearted are spoiled, they have slept their sleep: and none of the men of might have found their hands.","x":[["Ps.13.3",5,"w"],["Nah.3.18",5,"r"],["Isa.46.12",4,"w"],["Jer.51.39",4,"w"],["Luke.1.51",3,"r"],["Luke.1.52",3,"r"],["Ezek.30.21",3,"r"],["Ezek.30.25",3,"r"],["Isa.31.8",3,"r"],["Dan.4.37",3,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"At thy rebuke, O God of Jacob, both the chariot and horse are cast into a dead sleep.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Exod.15.1",6,"w"],["Exod.15.21",4,"w"],["Ps.80.16",3,"w"],["Ezek.39.20",3,"r"],["Zech.12.4",2,"w"],["Jer.51.39",2,"w"],["2Sam.10.18",2,"r"],["Ps.18.15",2,"w"],["Jer.51.57",2,"w"],["Exod.15.10",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Thou, even thou, art to be feared: and who may stand in thy sight when once thou art angry?","it":[[6,10],[17,20]],"x":[["Nah.1.6",8,"w"],["Ps.2.12",4,"w"],["Ps.89.7",3,"w"],["Ezra.9.15",2,"w"],["Ps.130.3",2,"w"],["Jer.10.7",2,"r"],["Jer.10.10",2,"r"],["Rev.6.16",2,"r"],["Rev.6.17",2,"w"],["1Cor.10.22",2,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Thou didst cause judgment to be heard from heaven; the earth feared, and was still,","x":[["2Chr.20.29",5,"r"],["2Chr.20.30",5,"r"],["Hab.2.20",3,"r"],["Ps.46.10",2,"w"],["Exod.19.10",2,"r"],["2Chr.32.20",2,"w"],["2Chr.32.22",2,"r"],["Ezek.38.20",2,"r"],["Ezek.38.23",2,"r"],["Judg.5.20",2,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"When God arose to judgment, to save all the meek of the earth. Selah.","x":[["Isa.11.4",3,"w"],["Matt.5.5",3,"w"],["Zeph.2.3",3,"w"],["Ps.9.7",3,"w"],["Ps.9.9",3,"r"],["1Pet.3.4",2,"w"],["Ps.72.4",2,"w"],["Ps.25.9",2,"w"],["Jer.5.28",2,"r"],["Ps.149.4",2,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"Surely the wrath of man shall praise thee: the remainder of wrath shalt thou restrain.","x":[["Acts.4.26",3,"r"],["Acts.4.28",3,"r"],["Matt.24.22",3,"r"],["Dan.3.19",3,"r"],["Dan.3.20",3,"r"],["Rom.9.17",3,"r"],["Matt.2.13",2,"r"],["Matt.2.16",2,"r"],["Gen.37.18",2,"r"],["Gen.37.20",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"Vow, and pay unto the LORD your God: let all that be round about him bring presents unto him that ought to be feared.","x":[["Eccl.5.4",10,"w"],["Eccl.5.6",10,"r"],["Ps.50.14",6,"w"],["Ps.68.29",5,"w"],["Ps.89.7",4,"w"],["Gen.31.42",4,"r"],["Ps.119.106",3,"r"],["Num.30.2",3,"w"],["2Chr.32.22",3,"r"],["2Chr.32.23",3,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"He shall cut off the spirit of princes: he is terrible to the kings of the earth.","it":[[40,45]],"x":[["Zeph.3.6",5,"w"],["Isa.13.6",4,"r"],["Isa.13.8",4,"r"],["2Chr.32.21",4,"w"],["Ps.68.12",4,"w"],["Ps.48.4",3,"w"],["Ps.48.6",3,"r"],["Ps.2.5",3,"r"],["Ps.2.10",3,"w"],["Ps.47.2",3,"w"]]}],"title":"To the chief Musician on Neginoth, A Psalm or Song of Asaph."}